    <ns1:definition xml:lang="en">Averaged senescence period duration expressed in days between 5 and 95% senescence (i.e. 95%  and 5% of maximum ground cover after time to maximum ground cover) in two subplots.
Ground cover computed from weekly images analysis. 
Time at 95% and 5% of maximum growth after time at maximum growth computed via inverse regression of time to event Beta ground cover dynamic model.</ns1:definition>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Duration between 5 and 95% senescence of subplot - Computation</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://cropontology.org/rdf/Computation"/>
  </ns2:Class>
